    <div class="section-label">The campaign brief</div>
    <h2 id="maxwell-engagement-title">Give prospects a reason to talk with the brokerage.</h2>
    <p class="cs2-intro">We called on behalf of MaxWell Realty brokerages. Some prospects wanted to reconnect with the brokerage, while others wanted property information. Interest in private or pocket listings gave the callers a specific topic to bring up. We offered to arrange a conversation about what the prospect was looking for and what the brokerage could share. <a href="https://www.maxwellrealty.ca/">About MaxWell Realty Canada <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
