    <h2 id="maxwell-campaign-title">We booked time when a prospect wanted to keep talking.</h2>
    <p class="cs2-intro">A question about private listings gave the next call a purpose. The prospect could tell the brokerage what kind of property they were looking for and ask about options beyond the listings they had already seen.</p>
